# Generator yield, ownership and close

The AV run checks use the ordinary language source entry. The original VM checks retain their oracles and conditions.

## Case: legacy-22-generator-001-sum
id: "legacy.22_generator.001_sum"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "sum.at"
```auto
fn counter() ~Iter<int> {
    yield 1
    yield 2
    yield 3
}
fn main() {
    var sum = 0
    for n in counter() {
        sum = sum + n
    }
    print(sum)
}
```

