## Case: loop-local
id: "av.parity.1089.loop-local"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn seq() ~Iter<int> {
 var i = 0
 for i < 10 {
  yield i * 2
  i += 1
  if i == 3 { break }
  if i == 1 { continue }
  yield i * 3
 }
}
fn main() int {
 var n = 0
 for e in seq() { n = n + e }
 return n + 30
}
```

