## Case: borrow-mut-prefix
id: "av.parity.1089.borrow-mut-prefix"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1089"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
type Tally { value int }
fn series(mut tally Tally, limit int) ~Iter<int> {
    tally.value = tally.value + 2
    let n = tally.value
    yield n
    yield limit
}
fn main() int {
    var tally = Tally(18)
    var sum = 0
    for n in series(tally.mut, 2) {
        sum += n
        if tally.value != 20 { return -1 }
    }
    return sum + tally.value
}
```

