## Case: drain-finally-once
id: "av.parity.1089.drain-finally-once"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1089"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn seq(events List<int>) ~Iter<int> {
    try { yield 19; yield 23 } finally { events.push(9) }
}
fn main() int {
    var events = List<int>.new()
    var it = seq(events)
    var n = 0
    for v in it { n = n + v }
    it.close()
    let extra = it.next() ?? 0
    if events.len() != 1 || events[0] != 9 { return 0 }
    return n + extra
}
```

