tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1089"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn seq(value int) ~Iter<int> {
    let marker = "x".clone()
    yield value + marker.len() - 1
}
fn choose(move it ~Iter<int>, yes bool) ~Iter<int> {
    if yes { return it.move }
    return seq(0)
}
fn main() int {
    let first = seq(42)
    var var_it = choose(first.move, true)
    return var_it.next() ?? 0
}
```

